# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""bootstrap_all - goi TUONG MINH moi `bootstrap_<module>()` theo thu tu co dinh.

P6, phuong an **B2** (spec Muc 4 da chot). Muc dich: import mot module cua
compiler KHONG duoc chay bat ky tac dung phu nao. Moi dang ky
(`register_line_parser`, `register_expr_builtin`, ...) gom vao mot ham
`bootstrap_<module>()`, va file NAY goi chung.

**Vi sao liet ke tuong minh, khong dung auto-registry:** mot
`register_bootstrap_fn(...)` chay luc import lai CHINH LA tac dung phu luc
import - tuc la chua giai quyet gi. Danh sach o day phai doc duoc bang mat
va so sanh duoc voi thuc te bang test (xem
test/verify/no_module_side_effects_test.py).

**THU TU LA MOT PHAN CUA HANH VI.** `il_codegen.py` ghi ro: thu tu
`LINE_PARSERS` mang y nghia cascade (`list_sort`/`list_extend` phai dang ky
TRUOC `method_call_stmt`). Dao thu tu = bien dich sai AM THAM.

**Thu tu duoi day KHONG phai doan:** no duoc do bang cach boc cac ham
`register_*` cua il_dispatch va chay tkv_compile that, ghi lai nhat ky dang
ky (377 loi goi, 74 khoi module - moi module lien tuc, khong xen ke). Xem
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-07-selfhost-P6-bootstrap-all.md Task 3.
Ly do phai DO chu khong doc code: `plugin_loader.load_plugins()` nap DONG
theo thu muc + co vong retry khi mot plugin phu thuoc plugin khac, nen thu
tu that KHONG suy ra duoc tu cac dong `import` tinh.
"""

from il_features.async_await import bootstrap_async_await
from il_features.bytearray_type import bootstrap_bytearray_type
from il_features.bytes_type import bootstrap_bytes_type
from il_features.closures import bootstrap_closures
